            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/singular+knots"} singular knots
          %h3#invariants Invariants
          %p
            A major line in the study of knots is to look for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/knot+invariants"} knot invariants
            (see also
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/link+invariants"} link invariants
          %h3#ancillary_pages Ancillary pages
          %p There are various pages related to knot theory that are linked from the main articles.
          %ul
